Hello World!

Firecrawl example
-----------------

examples/firecrawl_scrape.py scrapes a single URL with Firecrawl and prints the
page as markdown.

    pip install 'firecrawl-py>=4.43.0'
    export FIRECRAWL_API_KEY=fc-...          # get a key at https://firecrawl.dev
    python examples/firecrawl_scrape.py https://example.com

The URL argument is optional and defaults to https://example.com.

Firecrawl docs: https://docs.firecrawl.dev
